# Copy to .leakwords, which is never committed, and put one extended regular
# expression per line. The pre-commit hook rejects a commit whose staged diff
# matches any of them.
#
# Use it for the names a public repository must never receive: your employer,
# your clients, their internal systems and repositories, and the code names of
# projects you work on elsewhere.
#
# example-client-name
# internal-project-codename
# some-company\.com
